#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"B<ln>(1), B<namei>(1), B<lchown>(2), B<link>(2), B<lstat>(2), B<open>(2), "
"B<readlink>(2), B<rename>(2), B<unlink>(2), B<path_resolution>(7), "
